\name{rsemflow-package}
\alias{rsemflow-package}
\alias{rsemflow}
\title{RSEMflow: metadata-driven downstream analysis for RSEM}
\description{
RSEMflow imports RSEM \code{*.genes.results} files and ordinary sample
metadata, then produces tabular downstream-analysis results including
expression summaries, normalization, PCA, correlation, DESeq2 differential
expression, GSEA, GSVA/ssGSEA, and gene annotation.
}
\details{
The package is designed for local command-line use. It does not generate
figures or HTML reports.
}
